## 5. The mapper

**File:** `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` (MapStruct)

`toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` maps fields straight across, ignoring `id` and `pets`:

```java
